        "cooked": "<p><em><span>Having said that, I still have yet to unlock Skinny Gloomy due to the idea of protracted fight against Spite.</span></em></p><p><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Open Sans, HelveticaNeue, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span>You and me both. &nbsp;I'm thinking that for that fight, I'd take along at least 2 out of Wraith, Tach and Scholar so I can zero out Spite:AoGloom's damage the turn before he'd flip and from there go to town with the damage, clearing out the safe house ASAP and then using Eyepiece to keep Spite from wrecking a victim. &nbsp;</span></font></p><p><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Open Sans, HelveticaNeue, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span>But that'd require me to actually *play* against Spite so.... yeah.</span></font></p>",
