      {
        "id": 164734,
        "name": "schadkehnfreude",
        "username": "schadkehnfreude",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/schadkehnfreude/{size}/2357_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-03-06T00:00:22.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I went ahead and unlocked the Gloomy variant today - the team was Wraith, TL Tach, Dark Visionary, Scholar and Chrono, in that order. &nbsp;It went fine because I had a ton of damage reduction. &nbsp;Also you want a 5-hero team so that the turn after Spite:AoGloom flips each of your heros can pull out a victim so that when Chrono (the clean-up guy) starts his turn there are 5 victims in play and by then you've hopefully done enough chip damage that Chrono can finish Spite off. &nbsp;I'd actually whittled down Spite so much that I held back on the last round so that Chrono could get the kill-shot.</p><p>Still, though, Spite is such a *chore* to play against</p>",
